<title>INDIA: India CCI profit before extraordinary up.</title>
<headline>India CCI profit before extraordinary up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable Corporation of India Ltd's (CCI) profit before extraordinary income rose to 166.7 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March) from 164.4 million in 1995/96, the United News of India (UNI) said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company's turnover in 1996/97 rose to 2.40 billion rupees from 2.24 billion last year, UNI said.</p>
<p>The company has set a dividend of 50 percent for 1996/97, the news agency said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
